{"b":"Ps","c":77,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"I cried unto God with my voice, even unto God with my voice; and he gave ear unto me.","it":[[32,36]],"x":[["Ps.3.4",12,"w"],["Ps.142.1",5,"w"],["Ps.142.3",5,"r"],["Ps.39.1",5,"r"],["Ps.50.1",5,"r"],["Ps.62.1",4,"r"],["Ps.34.6",3,"w"],["1Chr.25.3",2,"r"],["1Chr.25.6",2,"r"],["Ps.55.16",2,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"In the day of my trouble I sought the Lord: my sore ran in the night, and ceased not: my soul refused to be comforted.","x":[["Ps.50.15",10,"w"],["Gen.37.35",9,"w"],["Isa.26.9",8,"w"],["Isa.26.16",7,"w"],["Heb.5.7",6,"r"],["Esth.4.1",5,"r"],["Esth.4.4",5,"r"],["Ps.102.1",4,"r"],["Ps.102.2",4,"w"],["Hos.5.13",4,"r"]]},{"n":3,"t":"I remembered God, and was troubled: I complained, and my spirit was overwhelmed. Selah.","x":[["Ps.61.2",6,"w"],["Ps.142.2",6,"r"],["Ps.142.3",6,"w"],["Job.31.23",5,"r"],["Job.23.15",4,"w"],["Job.23.16",4,"r"],["Ps.102.3",4,"r"],["Ps.102.28",4,"r"],["Lam.3.39",4,"r"],["Ps.42.11",4,"r"]]},{"n":4,"t":"Thou holdest mine eyes waking: I am so troubled that I cannot speak.","x":[["Job.7.13",5,"r"],["Job.7.15",5,"r"],["Ps.6.6",4,"r"],["Job.2.13",3,"r"],["Esth.6.1",2,"r"],["Job.6.3",2,"r"]]},{"n":5,"t":"I have considered the days of old, the years of ancient times.","x":[["Deut.32.7",6,"e"],["Isa.51.9",6,"w"],["Ps.143.5",5,"w"],["Ps.44.1",3,"w"],["Ps.74.12",2,"w"],["Ps.74.18",2,"r"],["Isa.63.9",2,"w"],["Isa.63.15",2,"r"],["Mic.7.14",2,"w"],["Mic.7.15",2,"r"]]},{"n":6,"t":"I call to remembrance my song in the night: I commune with mine own heart: and my spirit made diligent search.","x":[["Ps.42.8",11,"w"],["Ps.4.4",10,"w"],["Ps.139.23",6,"w"],["Ps.139.24",6,"r"],["Lam.3.40",5,"w"],["Job.10.2",5,"r"],["Eccl.1.16",5,"r"],["Acts.16.25",5,"r"],["Jonah.1.2",4,"r"],["Job.35.10",4,"w"]]},{"n":7,"t":"Will the Lord cast off for ever? and will he be favourable no more?","x":[["Ps.85.1",7,"w"],["Ps.89.46",6,"r"],["Lam.3.31",6,"q"],["Lam.3.32",6,"r"],["Ps.85.5",6,"r"],["Rom.11.1",6,"r"],["Rom.11.2",6,"r"],["Ps.13.1",3,"r"],["Ps.13.2",3,"r"],["Ps.37.24",3,"r"]]},{"n":8,"t":"Is his mercy clean gone for ever? doth his promise fail for evermore?","it":[[39,42]],"x":[["Num.23.19",4,"r"],["2Pet.3.9",4,"w"],["Rom.9.6",4,"r"],["Num.14.34",3,"w"],["Luke.16.25",3,"r"],["Luke.16.26",3,"r"],["Isa.27.11",2,"w"],["Jer.15.18",2,"w"]]},{"n":9,"t":"Hath God forgotten to be gracious? hath he in anger shut up his tender mercies? Selah.","x":[["Ps.40.11",3,"w"],["Isa.49.14",3,"w"],["Isa.49.15",3,"r"],["Rom.11.32",2,"r"],["Ps.25.6",2,"w"],["Ps.51.1",2,"e"],["1John.3.17",2,"r"],["Isa.63.15",2,"w"],["Luke.13.25",2,"w"],["Luke.13.28",2,"r"]]},{"n":10,"t":"And I said, This is my infirmity: but I will remember the years of the right hand of the most High.","it":[[17,19],[34,53]],"x":[["Job.42.3",4,"r"],["Mark.9.24",4,"r"],["Ps.31.22",4,"r"],["Exod.15.6",4,"w"],["Ps.77.5",3,"r"],["Hab.3.2",3,"w"],["Hab.3.13",3,"r"],["Lam.3.18",3,"r"],["Lam.3.23",3,"r"],["Ps.73.22",2,"r"]]},{"n":11,"t":"I will remember the works of the LORD: surely I will remember thy wonders of old.","x":[["Ps.143.5",14,"w"],["Ps.105.5",10,"e"],["1Chr.16.12",8,"e"],["Ps.28.5",5,"w"],["Isa.5.12",5,"r"],["Ps.77.10",4,"w"],["Ps.111.4",4,"w"],["Ps.78.11",4,"w"]]},{"n":12,"t":"I will meditate also of all thy work, and talk of thy doings.","x":[["Ps.71.24",5,"w"],["Ps.145.11",5,"w"],["Deut.6.7",4,"w"],["Ps.105.2",3,"w"],["Ps.145.4",3,"r"],["Ps.104.34",3,"r"],["Luke.24.14",3,"r"],["Luke.24.32",3,"r"],["Ps.143.5",3,"w"]]},{"n":13,"t":"Thy way, O God, is in the sanctuary: who is so great a God as our God?","it":[[16,18],[41,46],[62,65]],"tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O God”."},"x":[["Ps.73.17",8,"w"],["Exod.15.11",7,"r"],["Isa.40.25",6,"r"],["Ps.89.6",6,"r"],["Ps.89.8",6,"r"],["Deut.32.31",6,"r"],["Ps.27.4",5,"r"],["Ps.63.2",5,"w"],["Ps.71.19",4,"r"],["Ps.68.25",4,"r"]]},{"n":14,"t":"Thou art the God that doest wonders: thou hast declared thy strength among the people.","it":[[5,8]],"x":[["Ps.136.4",12,"w"],["Dan.6.27",11,"w"],["Exod.15.11",10,"w"],["Exod.13.14",9,"w"],["Ps.72.18",9,"r"],["Josh.9.9",8,"r"],["Josh.9.10",8,"r"],["Isa.51.9",8,"w"],["Exod.15.6",7,"r"],["Rev.15.3",7,"r"]]},{"n":15,"t":"Thou hast with thine arm redeemed thy people, the sons of Jacob and Joseph. Selah.","it":[[15,20]],"x":[["Exod.6.6",7,"w"],["Deut.9.29",7,"w"],["Ps.74.2",4,"w"],["Deut.9.26",4,"w"],["Isa.63.9",4,"w"],["Gen.48.3",3,"w"],["Gen.48.20",3,"r"],["Ps.136.11",3,"r"],["Ps.136.12",3,"w"]]},{"n":16,"t":"The waters saw thee, O God, the waters saw thee; they were afraid: the depths also were troubled.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O God”."},"x":[["Exod.14.21",9,"w"],["Hab.3.15",6,"w"],["Josh.3.15",6,"r"],["Josh.3.16",6,"w"],["Ps.114.3",5,"r"],["Ps.114.6",5,"r"],["Hab.3.8",2,"r"],["Hab.3.10",2,"r"]]},{"n":17,"t":"The clouds poured out water: the skies sent out a sound: thine arrows also went abroad.","x":[["Ps.18.14",4,"w"],["Ps.68.33",2,"r"],["Judg.5.4",2,"w"],["Ps.144.6",2,"w"],["Hab.3.11",2,"w"],["Ps.68.8",2,"r"],["Ps.68.9",2,"r"],["2Sam.22.15",2,"w"]]},{"n":18,"t":"The voice of thy thunder was in the heaven: the lightnings lightened the world: the earth trembled and shook.","it":[[25,28]],"x":[["Ps.97.4",5,"e"],["2Sam.22.14",3,"r"],["Rev.11.19",3,"w"],["Rev.18.1",2,"w"],["Hab.3.4",2,"r"],["Matt.27.51",2,"r"],["2Sam.22.8",2,"e"],["Ps.18.7",2,"w"],["Judg.5.4",2,"w"],["Job.37.1",2,"r"]]},{"n":19,"t":"Thy way is in the sea, and thy path in the great waters, and thy footsteps are not known.","it":[[8,10]],"x":[["Exod.14.28",5,"w"],["Neh.9.11",4,"w"],["Hab.3.15",4,"e"],["Nah.1.3",4,"r"],["Nah.1.4",4,"w"],["Ps.29.10",4,"r"],["Ps.97.2",3,"r"],["Rom.11.33",3,"r"]]},{"n":20,"t":"Thou leddest thy people like a flock by the hand of Moses and Aaron.","x":[["Exod.13.21",8,"r"],["Isa.63.11",7,"w"],["Isa.63.12",7,"r"],["Ps.78.52",7,"e"],["Exod.14.19",7,"r"],["Ps.80.1",5,"w"],["Hos.12.13",3,"r"],["Acts.7.35",3,"r"],["Acts.7.36",3,"r"]]}],"title":"To the chief Musician, to Jeduthun, A Psalm of Asaph."}